{"server":"tw","storyId":"act32side_level_act32side_03_end","groupId":"act32side","stageId":"act32side_03","title":"假面舞池","storyCode":"CR-3","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act32side/level_act32side_03_end.txt","sourceHash":"e966a140d87f6021d583190b554ebe1af31a23ddc998ea2bba6da02fad433db9","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"48_g9_gangsters"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FUZE","speakerId":"avg_4126_fuze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……呃，頭好痛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你醒了，大個子，來，這是冰塊，你的額頭腫了很大一個包。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FUZE","speakerId":"avg_4126_fuze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你、你是攻擊我的那個小孩？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再叫我一句小孩我就讓你後腦勺再腫一個包。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FUZE","speakerId":"avg_4126_fuze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……發生什麼事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"總之就是，他們遺失的藥品找回來了，所以他們和我們之間的誤會也解除了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FUZE","speakerId":"avg_4126_fuze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼藥品？什麼誤會？怎麼解決的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"DOC","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"透過一位可憐的司機先生，他的嘴很硬，但又沒那麼硬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FUZE","speakerId":"avg_4126_fuze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不……我覺得更混亂了……我們現在在哪裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"DOC","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧，我扶你出去看看。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"48_g8_slums"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ELA","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您的藥，請拿好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"社區居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"哦……謝謝……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你叫什麼？在這裡打個勾。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"社區居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"邁克……好了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ELA","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，這裡還剩兩份。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我再從頭核對一下名單，說不定是有人忘了拿……看看還有誰沒來簽字。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……最後兩份藥是我的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ELA","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"給你，特克諾小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳……今天發生的事情我很抱歉，我們不知道搶劫事件另有他人指使……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ELA","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係，這些藥品能物歸原主就是最好的結果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ELA","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"古斯塔夫告訴我，這裡很多人都患有一種特殊疾病，如果沒有這些抑製藥劑，後果不堪設想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"話說，那個上尉不是之前和雷內爾不對盤嗎？為什麼一轉臉就要搶我們的藥來討好雷內爾？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ELA","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"米沃什告訴我，他是衝著雷內爾手裡對這片社區的開發權而來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，有開發權又如何？這兩年就算雷內爾自己拿著開發文件不也一樣對我們束手無策。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ELA","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那挺好，你們的社區文化很吸引人，就這樣被開發成酒店賭場我覺得很可惜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不過是在這裡站了半天罷了，講得好像很瞭解這裡一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ELA","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過半天，但幾乎每個來領藥的人都極力向我推銷自己的藝術作品。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還是要吃飯的嘛……話說你手臂上那是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ELA","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是串刺繡手鍊，本來不打算買的，但是看見那孩子滿手都是針扎的痕跡……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）誰家的孩子啊，這麼笨手笨腳的……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ELA","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你剛說什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃……我說……你想去我的工作室坐坐嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g6_noblelivingroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拍賣會主持人","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"五千萬哥倫比亞金券，沒有再加價的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拍賣會主持人","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"好的，五千萬金券落槌！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷內爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說什麼……一直丟東西的倉庫？哪間倉庫？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ELA","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就是被你收購半年之後就倒閉的那家藥廠的倉庫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷內爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，好像是有這麼回事……所以有人搶了那片社區的藥，栽贓到你們頭上，然後又想偷偷把藥運到那間倉庫去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ELA","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"準確來說，就是你頭上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷內爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我現在該怎麼做？謝謝你幫我化解了這場誤會？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ELA","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用謝，雷內爾先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷內爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽米沃什說你們打算離開我提供的住所了。怎麼，找到自己的朋友們了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ELA","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我們只是找到了另外一處落腳的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷內爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ELA","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那片社區。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷內爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那裡？雖然我也沒什麼異議，但你們為什麼要離開？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ELA","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在那裡看到了些很有意思的東西。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"48_g9_gangsters"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡就是我的工作室了。這裡空間很大，我和其他的藝術家在這裡共同創作，尋找靈感，有的作品也在這裡展出。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ELA","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些浸濕了的畫紙，看來是一些廢棄的靈感了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，那個是作品。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ELA","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"作品？？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有個傢伙每畫完一幅畫都會把畫拿到室外，一直等到下雨，讓雨水化開已經鋪陳好的顏料，改變原有的畫面，這幅畫才算完成。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ELA","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ELA","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個正在展現自己完美肌肉線條的男人……應該在尋找靈感？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嚴格來說，他也是作品。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ELA","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，行為藝術。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"前面有個牌子，你要不要讀一讀？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ELA","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“作品名，佩佩·圖里翁……作者，佩佩·圖里翁的父母……”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ELA","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“作品簡介，作者在作品問世半年後因嫌棄作品沒有經濟價值，將其丟棄至多索雷斯城郊……”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ELA","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“作者未曾想到……二十年後……佩佩·圖里翁……成為了多索雷斯的傳世名作……老傢伙們，後悔去吧！”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ELA","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哇……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴肅的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"各位，我是多索雷斯最偉大的源石技藝大師。你們是否想觀摩我的源石技藝？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FUZE","speakerId":"avg_4126_fuze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特克諾，他比你還厲害？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在源石技藝上，無人能出其右。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FUZE","speakerId":"avg_4126_fuze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"展示的時候小心一點，可別傷到客人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴肅的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"男人從口袋裡掏出數顆隱隱泛出橙黃色光芒的黑色晶體。四人謹慎地往後退了幾步。\n至純源石在男人寬大的掌心中滴溜溜旋轉，然後被男人挨個拋到天上——\n他開始用至純源石做拋接球。\n數輪拋接之後，男人把所有的至純源石一口氣拋上天，仰面朝天，用鼻尖穩穩接住第一顆下落的至純源石。\n兩顆，三顆，四顆……最終，所有的晶體一顆接一顆，在男人的鼻尖上穩穩疊成一座高塔。\n男人稍微側了側頭，至純源石疊成的塔幾乎平移一樣回到他的手心裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"源石技藝……不是閃光、火球什麼的嗎？這……也是源石技藝？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴肅的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這難道不是源石？我剛剛展示的難道不是技藝？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"確……實……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"終於到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"打開你們面前這扇門，就是我們最重磅的藝術品。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"DOC","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然這話最近好像說過，但我還想再說一次——我看見什麼都已經不會覺得奇怪了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ELA","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"兩個……大木偶的頭？這麼大？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這還只是頭呢，等身體組裝起來會更大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們的藝術節開幕那一夜，她們將成為兩位舞者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當雙月緩緩落下，日光卻還沒照耀到我們的時候，她們將會起舞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她們會成為目光的焦點、藝術節的主角，她們會用最美的舞姿在街道上翩翩旋轉，她們會代替我們踩著韻律，轉遍整個社區。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FUZE","speakerId":"avg_4126_fuze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很美的畫面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ELA","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到那時，我想一定也會有許多人跟著人偶一起舞蹈吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，也許……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……當年舞廳發生火災後，已經許久沒有人願意起舞了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g6_noblelivingroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ELA","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就像我跟你說的，那裡有很多新奇的結構、充沛的情感、精妙的表達。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷內爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有意思……你的描述確實讓我對這些人在做的東西好奇起來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷內爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然你打算去那個社區，不如替我去看看那裡的人究竟要做什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ELA","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不是一直很反感他們把藝術節和你的開幕式定在同一天嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷內爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這不代表我不能對他們要做的東西感興趣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ELA","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以替你去看他們在做什麼，但我沒理由介入你和他們的衝突。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷內爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼會讓你介入？當然，如果你真的能說動那些人，讓他們換個日子，我會非常感激。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ELA","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……這可沒辦法保證。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷內爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"試試總比不試好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ELA","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不管怎麼說，你願意去瞭解那些人在做的事情讓我很驚訝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷內爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷內爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你願意瞭解我，我想你應該就不會驚訝了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ELA","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我以為……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拍賣會主持人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"257號藏品音樂盒，一千五百萬金券起拍，有人要加價嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷內爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噓……現在我得專心投入進去了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷內爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（舉牌）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拍賣會主持人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝您的競投，兩千萬，還有人要加嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷內爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（舉牌）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拍賣會主持人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呃……同一人，加到二千五百萬？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷內爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（舉牌）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ELA","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你已經抬得夠高了，場子裡根本沒人跟你爭！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷內爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（舉牌）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷內爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我才不在乎別人出什麼價，我只想把它加到我心裡的價位。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_offce"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"馬特奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1210_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是，是我太魯莽了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"馬特奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1210_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我們確實也沒想到那群瘋子真有這麼無法無天，居然敢這麼羞辱聯合政府的職業軍人……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"馬特奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1210_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明白，明白！我下次——不，絕對沒有下次了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"馬特奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1210_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是再有下次，您撤了我的職，處分我，怎樣都可以！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帶隊的軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上尉……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"馬特奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1210_1","isRemote":false,"text":"閉嘴吧，這下上面也知道門口那個開卡車的活寶了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"馬特奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1210_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他被脫光衣服扔到了我們辦公室大門口，上面覺得這是對聯合政府的公然侮辱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"馬特奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1210_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們問我和雷內爾的合作關係還能不能維持，那塊地皮還有沒有希望拿到，我能說什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"馬特奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1210_1","isRemote":false,"text":"*粗口*，這些個辦事不力的蠢貨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帶隊的軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上尉，我是想說，雷內爾的秘書來了……我們見還是不見？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"馬特奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1210_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……讓他進來吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"馬特奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1210_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你是代表雷內爾來興師問罪的，那就免了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米沃什","speakerId":"avg_npc_1213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼會呢，馬特奧先生？雷內爾對您的效率是很滿意的，美中不足的是，您的行動方式多少有些冒險了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米沃什","speakerId":"avg_npc_1213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那片社區的感染者數量不小，搶藥確實是個瓦解他們的方法。可您應該想到，假如真的有很多感染者因此去世……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米沃什","speakerId":"avg_npc_1213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"處理不好，我們誰都無法交代。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"馬特奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1210_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……這個問題我們已經意識到了。那他……還跟你說什麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米沃什","speakerId":"avg_npc_1213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個嘛，他的意思是，既然之前太過冒險了，現在不如稍微謹慎一些，說不定還能有和平解決的餘地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"馬特奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1210_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，都到這個時候了，你反而要我去跟那些人談判？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米沃什","speakerId":"avg_npc_1213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"馬特奧先生，您會錯意了，這事不用您操心，雷內爾先生已經派人去做了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"馬特奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1210_1","isRemote":false,"text":"誰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米沃什","speakerId":"avg_npc_1213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"ELA小姐和她的小隊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米沃什","speakerId":"avg_npc_1213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您想必很熟悉他們，我沒說錯吧？他們和您的手下打過照面，甚至還有人把您的手下和他們弄混呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"馬特奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1210_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不要忘了，米沃什，我們可是做了約定的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米沃什","speakerId":"avg_npc_1213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"稍安勿躁，馬特奧先生，雷內爾不打算放棄和您合作，只是希望您能稍微冷靜一段時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米沃什","speakerId":"avg_npc_1213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"地皮的事情，希望等您冷靜下來我們再談。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米沃什","speakerId":"avg_npc_1213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您還有什麼話要我帶給雷內爾先生嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"馬特奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1210_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米沃什","speakerId":"avg_npc_1213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我先告辭了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"馬特奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1210_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原來……你*粗口*是耍著我玩來的，對吧，雷內爾？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"馬特奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1210_1","isRemote":false,"text":"*粗口*……雷內爾，要是我最後沒能從你手中拿到那塊地，你就死定了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"48_g8_slums"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一億五千萬？他一個人把一個音樂盒加到一億五千萬？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ELA","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從他的出價來看，雖然這傢伙隨心所欲，但至少對他認定是藝術的東西還算真誠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽起來你對他有些改觀……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ELA","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我對他從來就沒有什麼意見，邁耶，他只是個很難捉摸的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這也是他有意思的地方？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ELA","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"確實……我承認，他不是傳統意義上那種無趣的藝術品商人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能從你的口中聽到這樣的評價已經算是不錯了，很難得有一個你不那麼反感的雇主。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那之後呢？你打算繼續與他的契約嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ELA","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不清楚……但我會考慮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說起來，我們是該謝謝他，如果不是他提供的幫助，我們不會這麼快適應這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ELA","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看在我們救了他的份上，不用客氣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿……ELA，你能和我來一下嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ELA","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，什麼事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是這樣的，老爹想要見你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ELA","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"迪亞茲先生？他為什麼找我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老爹說有些問題想要當面問你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ELA","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，我這就去見他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有就是那個……期間他可能會表現得很兇……非常可怕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ELA","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦……他打算給我個下馬威。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然他自己不這麼認為，但……的確是的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
